			"id":"ba219726e6f984b7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### [[Hunter's Mark]]\n#### Use Cost (Bonus Action)\n3x Free Uses or 1st Level Spell Slot\n- Recharge on [[Long Rest]]\n\n#### Effect\nOnce per turn, deal +1d6 Force Damage on Marked Target\n- If marked target dies, Bonus Action to move to new target\n\n",
